{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/92b62718a3d3e4c7a31970c66a7565f0.avif?t=1766136094\" width=938 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akashic</strong> is a storybook-style game that mixes <strong>AI-generated storytelling</strong>, <strong>Roguelite gameplay</strong>, and <strong>role-playing elements</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a bear who can connect to the <strong>Akashic Records</strong>, traveling through many different worlds to change fate. There\u2019s no fixed story \u2014 everything changes based on your choices, emotions, and how you interact with the world. Each adventure is unique and created by powerful AI systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa3 Item Combination </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3b3b536d2a93a3f5cee5f915f3663046.poster.avif?t=1766136094\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3b3b536d2a93a3f5cee5f915f3663046.webm?t=1766136094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3b3b536d2a93a3f5cee5f915f3663046.mp4?t=1766136094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can combine items during your journey to interact with the world and change the story.<br>Each item does something different \u2014 some are helpful, some are surprising.<br>Use your creativity to find secret uses, unlock new story paths, and discover rare items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc33\u00a0<strong>Create Your Own Character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/0f96033163f967df785a6c76d2226b61.avif?t=1766136094\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's look, personality, and emotions.<br>How you act and feel will change how other characters see you \u2014 and how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a character \u2014 This is <strong>you</strong>, rewritten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Fight Against Destiny \u2013 Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3f27ac2aabef84b2dc2fe63bc9c63f45.avif?t=1766136094\" width=1574 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world hides a guardian \u2014 a manifestation of fate, trauma, or forgotten memories.<br>These bosses aren\u2019t just enemies\u2026 they are <strong>questions</strong>, waiting to be answered through battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss evolves with your journey \u2014 no fight is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you conquer your shadow? Or become it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852130?t=1766136094","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852130?t=1766136094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/ce5b9ba67ed2955e714aacc26aff1f915217e542/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766136094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/ce5b9ba67ed2955e714aacc26aff1f915217e542/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766136094","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Chat Text-to-speech","id":73},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/92b62718a3d3e4c7a31970c66a7565f0.avif?t=1766136094\" width=938 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akashic</strong> is a storybook-style game that mixes <strong>AI-generated storytelling</strong>, <strong>Roguelite gameplay</strong>, and <strong>role-playing elements</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a bear who can connect to the <strong>Akashic Records</strong>, traveling through many different worlds to change fate. There\u2019s no fixed story \u2014 everything changes based on your choices, emotions, and how you interact with the world. Each adventure is unique and created by powerful AI systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa3 Item Combination </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3b3b536d2a93a3f5cee5f915f3663046.poster.avif?t=1766136094\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3b3b536d2a93a3f5cee5f915f3663046.webm?t=1766136094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3b3b536d2a93a3f5cee5f915f3663046.mp4?t=1766136094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can combine items during your journey to interact with the world and change the story.<br>Each item does something different \u2014 some are helpful, some are surprising.<br>Use your creativity to find secret uses, unlock new story paths, and discover rare items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc33\u00a0<strong>Create Your Own Character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/0f96033163f967df785a6c76d2226b61.avif?t=1766136094\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's look, personality, and emotions.<br>How you act and feel will change how other characters see you \u2014 and how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a character \u2014 This is <strong>you</strong>, rewritten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Fight Against Destiny \u2013 Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852130/extras/3f27ac2aabef84b2dc2fe63bc9c63f45.avif?t=1766136094\" width=1574 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world hides a guardian \u2014 a manifestation of fate, trauma, or forgotten memories.<br>These bosses aren\u2019t just enemies\u2026 they are <strong>questions</strong>, waiting to be answered through battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss evolves with your journey \u2014 no fight is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you conquer your shadow? Or become it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["yayapipi","bamaogi"],"genres":[{"descri